_**atoms/AmountPill**_

```
interface AmountPillProps {
  amount : number
}
```

_**organism/FilterSheet/FilterSheetCheckboxListItem**_

```
interface FilterSheetCheckboxListItemProps {
  id: string; // filter-value id
  label: string;
  count?: number;
}
```

Has model created with `defineModel<boolean>("checked")`

_**organism/FilterSheet/FilterSheetCheckboxList**_

```
interface FilterSheetCheckboxList {
  id: string; // filter-id
  items: FilterSheetCheckboxListItemProps[];
}
```

Use LuiSearchbar if more than 10 elements are in the list. Use LuiAmountPill from <custom data-type="smartlink" data-id="id-1">https://laioutr.atlassian.net/browse/LUI-88</custom> 

Has model, created with `defineModel<string[]>('checked')` which is a list of active item-ids.
